{"package":"devModulesDirMonitor","version":"0.0.2.0","assessment":"complete","packageSha256":"8fc7791063e10eb6216ff190cef1fdd014afee9a6866ca01bcad6c64eed10fa1","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T09:23:21.753Z","scannerVersion":"0.1.0","rulesetVersion":"0.1.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.5.12","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0"},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/devModulesDirMonitor/0.0.2.0","metadata":{"title":"devModulesDirMonitor","description":"Provides functions (cmdlets) to monitor changes in modules in developer folder. Updated module will be updated via command Import-Module $modName -Force.\r\n\r\nHow to use.\r\n\r\nAdd the following code in your project entry point file.\r\n\r\n    function monitorChangesInModules($dir) {\r\n        startDirMonitor $dir\r\n\r\n        if ($updatedModules) {\r\n            foreach ($modName in $updatedModules) { \r\n                Import-Module \"$modName\" -Force\r\n            }\r\n            resetChangedModulesList\r\n        } \r\n    }\r\n    $dirToWatch = \".\\myModules\"\r\n    monitorChangesInModules($dirToWatch)","authors":"Dmitry Molchanov","owners":"dmpost","projectUrl":"","publishedAt":"2019-11-14T10:43:24.183","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T20:20:01.44","tags":["PSModule","PSFunction_resetChangedModulesList","PSCommand_resetChangedModulesList","PSFunction_startDirMonitor","PSCommand_startDirMonitor","PSIncludes_Function"]},"dependencies":[],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":514,"crc32":"e93318a8","extension":"rels"},{"path":"devModulesDirMonitor.nuspec","size":1248,"crc32":"53f0cd6e","extension":"nuspec"},{"path":"devModulesDirMonitor.psd1","size":850,"crc32":"365467bc","extension":"psd1"},{"path":"devModulesDirMonitor.psm1","size":2304,"crc32":"51f7b7d3","extension":"psm1"},{"path":"[Content_Types].xml","size":530,"crc32":"9faf301f","extension":"xml"},{"path":"package/services/metadata/core-properties/7d2a9a6871a1465aa66d1e03fcd6fc02.psmdcp","size":1353,"crc32":"0b0